== SAVE and LOAD
> SAVE "HELLO"
SAVING HELLO
> N$ = "COPY.TXT": SAVE N$, 8
SAVING COPY.TXT
> X = 41: NEW
> X = 41
> LOAD "HELLO"
SEARCHING FOR HELLO
LOADING
> LIST
10 PRINT "HELLO";
20 PRINT "WORLD"
30 X = X + 1: PRINT X
> PRINT X
 0 
> RUN
HELLOWORLD
 1 
> SAVE "ZERO"
SAVING ZERO
> LOAD "ZERO": LIST
SEARCHING FOR ZERO
LOADING
0 REM MINE
10 PRINT "TEN"
> LOAD "HAND": LIST
SEARCHING FOR HAND
LOADING
10 PRINT "by hand"
20 GOTO 10
> LOAD "NOTHERE"
SEARCHING FOR NOTHERE
?FILE NOT FOUND ERROR
> LOAD "BAD"
SEARCHING FOR BAD
?FILE DATA ERROR
> LOAD "BIG"
SEARCHING FOR BIG
?FILE DATA ERROR
> LOAD "BBC"
SEARCHING FOR BBC
?UNKNOWN DIALECT ERROR
> LIST
10 PRINT "KEPT"
> SAVE
?MISSING FILE NAME ERROR
> LOAD ""
?MISSING FILE NAME ERROR
> SAVE 5
?TYPE MISMATCH ERROR
> SAVE "NODIR/X"
SAVING NODIR/X
?WRITE ERROR
== chaining
> RUN
PART 2, X = 7 
> LIST
10 PRINT "PART 2, X ="; X
== RENUM
> RENUM
?UNDEF'D STATEMENT 99 IN 30
> LIST
0 REM HEADER OF MY OWN
10 ON K GOSUB 20, 30: IF K THEN 30 ELSE 40
20 GOTO20
30 RESTORE 40: GOSUB 99
40 DATA 1: PRINT "GOTO 5": REM GOTO 5
50 IFX>1THEN10ELSE20
60 RUN 10
> RENUM 100, 5
?UNDEF'D STATEMENT 99 IN 110
> LIST
0 REM HEADER OF MY OWN
100 ON K GOSUB 105, 110: IF K THEN 110 ELSE 115
105 GOTO105
110 RESTORE 115: GOSUB 99
115 DATA 1: PRINT "GOTO 5": REM GOTO 5
120 IFX>1THEN100ELSE105
125 RUN 100
> RENUM 1000, 0
?ILLEGAL QUANTITY ERROR
> RENUM 63990
?ILLEGAL QUANTITY ERROR
> LIST 100-110
100 ON K GOSUB 105, 110: IF K THEN 110 ELSE 115
105 GOTO105
110 RESTORE 115: GOSUB 99
> RENUM 1, 1: RUN
 4 
> LIST
1 X = 1
2 X = X + 1: IF X < 4 THEN 2
3 PRINT X
== AUTO
> AUTO
> AUTO 63990, 5
> AUTO 100, 0
?ILLEGAL QUANTITY ERROR
